QA4 C4. A library package with no main: the Target's callers are not seen. A
tracked wrapper is handed, as an error, to a function value that comes from
outside before it is unwrapped; its field is exported, so that code can set it
(e.(*lib.W).Inner = ...). The literal's value is listed with one Unresolved
entry for what that code may have stored.
